# M10/031 — R-206: migration 007 DRAFT (finding 2: call-log retention) — D-163 PROPOSED
date: 2026-11-18
branch: m10/r206-007-draft (on top of m10/r206-defects / PR #384)
status: DRAFT — owner decision pending. NOT applied to any Supabase project. No production access used in this batch.

## What 007 does (option B of M10/030 §D)
1. agos.model_calls.workspace_id: NOT NULL dropped; FK model_calls_workspace_id_fkey -> ON DELETE SET NULL.
   - row kept after its workspace is deleted, invisible to every user (006 RLS needs is_member(workspace_id), false for NULL), visible to service_role only.
   - user deletion unchanged: cascade erases all their rows, kept ones included (D-155).
2. agos.model_call_record: known tokens/cost are added to provider_keys totals for an active key whether ok or not
   (billed failures such as empty_output now count). NULL usage adds nothing. Closes the limit declared in M10/030.
Rollback 007_model_calls_retention_rollback.sql: DELETES rows with workspace_id NULL (documented data loss), restores
NOT NULL + CASCADE + the 006 function body byte for byte.

